{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[3].text","source_sha256":"053a63bbf1883d9c525519484d8392724727642b00c3a87c558e7a4440e863c7","ja":"レモンパワーをさらにチャージ！","zh":"为柠檬力量进一步充能！","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:16+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"720a80eb665023845208e2031f7d1eada8dca4303017b17c49bef7b39b1cf64c","ja":"じゃじゃーん♪　実家からたくさんレモンが\n届いたから、はちみつレモンも作ったの～♪","zh":"锵锵——♪　老家寄来了好多柠檬，\n所以我也做了蜂蜜渍柠檬哦～♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"c457af8f5bc1a4f4f0d0b5fe3ec25005760c49bede225bf94c1dbf58ee079717","ja":"へぇ～！\nちょうど、甘いものが欲しかったんだ。","zh":"欸～！\n正好想吃点甜的呢。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"f87a8b559f2cd7ff86d0b28ab084583275ecea83cd032a91ac79cc417151d8e4","ja":"でしょ？　レモンで心身ともにリフレッシュして、\n最後まで頑張りましょう♪","zh":"对吧？用柠檬让身心都焕然一新，\n一起努力到最后吧♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"675438efe9545d6d5733f9bd4899d5f9bb37015c5479729f34e754605fa750e0","ja":"はちみつレモンも、とてもおいしいです～。\nレモンパワーで、元気はつらつですな～。","zh":"蜂蜜柠檬也非常好喝呢～。\n靠着柠檬的力量，整个人都充满活力了呀～。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[15].text","source_sha256":"e09079e3d22e2fd9aa141ce5acf39f13350a07e4d079ec1799b7eef1995ee09b","ja":"うん♪　それになんだか、\nちょっと涼しくなったカンジなの！","zh":"嗯♪ 而且总觉得，\n好像变得有点凉爽了呢！","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"0a42603f23155b136b63eff55769db78ac6d96bf569706cf8bca71280386ef0c","ja":"そして残りの撮影も無事に終わり……","zh":"然后剩下的拍摄也顺利结束了……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"0a8005b753771187576eaf6f1bc7945aacbef7d8cba512af810c5814933b8c38","ja":"お疲れさまなの～☆　莉緒のおかげで、\nバッチリだったって思うな♪","zh":"辛苦啦～☆ 多亏了莉绪，\n我觉得完成得超棒的♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[25].text","source_sha256":"2ec30a50aedca27421cb4d2e2496be2ec0d9ddffc52dfc80e43d3ae9a0a8a238","ja":"ああ。さすが莉緒姉だよな。ウチらと同じくらい\nきついはずなのに、まわりに気を遣ってくれてさ。","zh":"啊。真不愧是莉绪姐呢。明明应该和我们\n一样吃力，却还在体贴顾及周围的人。","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[33].text","source_sha256":"6b4f15d6ca72a24713aeeaa0203cdcfbc3a180600a328720c23470ae69146153","ja":"あら、そんな大したことしてないわよ。\nみんなを助けてくれたのは、レモンの力だもの♪","zh":"哎呀，我没做什么大不了的事啦。\n真正帮了大家的，是柠檬的力量嘛♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[34].text","source_sha256":"2340be3520a70b01e8af79a816fa2e6cb3f3025c7da5de5c13a9d254113421cb","ja":"それでは、莉緒さんとレモンのおかげ、\nということですね～。","zh":"也就是说，多亏了莉绪和柠檬\n对吧～","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[35].text","source_sha256":"1c6aadcd498148e4c3eb4930219fb4de2df00c14bea40ae51fa2d955f2826f8d","ja":"そう言ってもらえると嬉しいわ。\nでもね、まだ終わりじゃないのよ♪","zh":"你能这么说我很开心。\n不过呢，现在可还没结束哦♪","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1616.unity3d","item_key":"commands[36].text","source_sha256":"9a174671835cc3e5a73811e08ae66cbbb4c11699267e8be5dbc464dc7e6faf8b","ja":"おや～？　この流れはもしかして～……。","zh":"哎呀～？这个走向难道说～……","status":"pending","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T15:49:47+00:00"}
